sequenceDiagram

    actor Employee
    participant Client as MAUI / Web Client
    participant API as Advance API
    participant Service as Advance Service
    participant DB as SQL Server
    participant Audit as Audit Service
    participant Notify as Notification Service

    Employee->>Client: Enter advance request
    Client->>API: POST /advances
    API->>API: Authenticate & authorize
    API->>Service: Submit advance request
    Service->>Service: Validate business rules
    Service->>DB: Save AdvanceRequest
    DB-->>Service: Saved
    Service->>Audit: Record creation event
    Service->>Notify: Notify Super Admin
    Service-->>API: Advance created
    API-->>Client: Success + Pending status
    Client-->>Employee: Display request status